Short:        OpenGL cube demo from O'Reilly Net
Author:       Chris Halsall (chalsall@chalsall.com)
Uploader:     polluks sdf lonestar org (Stefan Haubenthal)
Type:         dev/src
Version:      1.0
Requires:     StormMesa libraries, Warp3D or Wazp3D library, 68020+
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0; ppc-morphos

DESCRIPTION 
O'Reilly Net OpenGL cube demo . Author C.Halsall
Written by Chris Halsall (chalsall@chalsall.com) for the
O'Reilly Network on Linux.com (oreilly.linux.com).
May 2000.
Released into the Public Domain; do with it as you wish.
We would like to hear about interesting uses.
Coded to the groovy tunes of Yello: Pocket Universe.

LICENSE 
Public Domain.

INSTALLATION 
Install StormMesa libraries
Install Warp3D or Wazp3D library
copy oreilly-cube where you want
